# Branding

Rice (`public/images/branding/rice/`):

- CSS primary is Rice Blue `#00205B` from https://brand.rice.edu/colors.
- Rice Gray `#7C7E7F` may be used for chrome, not as body text if contrast fails.
- Do not recolor, crop, or redraw official marks. Leave SVG internal fills unchanged (including `#002169`).
- The Rice shield must never be used alone. Do not make a shield-only favicon. The site favicon is a typeset letter, not an official mark.
- Do not build a homemade Rice + SIAM lockup. Place marks side by side with clear space.
- Until Public Affairs issues a chapter lockup, the header is the official Rice mark (shield + RICE) plus typeset chapter name. Official SIAM marks belong in the footer and must link to `https://www.siam.org`.

SIAM (`public/images/branding/siam/`):

- Use unaltered official wordmarks. On the website the SIAM logo must link to `https://www.siam.org`.
- Do not use `in-cooperation-siam-*` as chapter identity.
- Do not create a custom chapter logo without SIAM Marketing review.

Site:

- Rice-first identity. SIAM teal is an optional accent only.
- Keep Atkinson Hyperlegible unless accessibility requires a change.
- Do not download random logos or fonts. SIAM print EPS lives in `brand-assets/siam/` and is not deployed. Rice print EPS stays in the University Logos Box download (too large for git); see `brand-assets/rice/README.md`.
